## Components

One `###` subsection per shared component. The `###` prefix is load-bearing: the audit config uses
it to enumerate what is documented, so a component described in prose under a different heading
level is invisible to the audit.

**If this project has a dedicated `components` document**, that document owns the per-component
pages and this section is a single link to it plus, at most, the list of component *names*. Do not
maintain both — a component documented in two places is documented in neither.

For each: what it is for, its variants and states, and — most usefully — **when not to use it**.
A component with no stated boundary gets used everywhere and stops meaning anything.

