## Definition of Done

A change to the presentation layer is not done until:

- [ ] It uses tokens, not literals
- [ ] Every state a consumer can reach is handled — at minimum loading, error, and empty, wherever
      the surface can be in those states
- [ ] Interactive elements meet the accessibility minimums above
- [ ] New shared components are documented — here in §Components, or in the `components` document
      if this project has one
- [ ] **New or changed surfaces are reflected in the Screen Inventory**
- [ ] Any new deliberate rule-break is added to §Accepted exceptions

